# Rubble Rouser's "{T}, Exile a card from your graveyard: Add {R}. When you do, this creature deals 1 damage to each opponent."
# Refused the turn it enters (summoning sickness, CR 302.6). Next turn Bot1 taps it, exiling the Memnite, in its own right: the mana ability
# does not use the stack (CR 605.3b) but its reflexive trigger (CR 603.12) does, and goes on the stack at once, before the Bolt is cast.
# The Bolt, cast above it, resolves first: Bot2 is at 17 after one round of passes and 16 when the ping has resolved too.

